# Deprecated filename kept for older docs/scripts.
#
# VPS single env SSOT is:
#   deploy/prod/minos.env.example  →  /opt/minos/deploy/minos.env
#
# Compose still expects a project-dir `.env` for variable substitution.
# On the VPS that file should be a symlink:
#   ln -sfn /opt/minos/deploy/minos.env /opt/minos/deploy/.env
#
# Copy the canonical template instead of this file:
#   cp deploy/prod/minos.env.example /opt/minos/deploy/minos.env
